  unitName: Fire Ghost
  unitId: 10202
  unitNumber: 254
  description: This subspecies of Metal Ghost is said to have changed after having
    amassed extensive records on the element of fire. Known for their offensive way
    of speaking, they constantly vilify Summoners they come across before quickly
    running away. Because of this they are rarely seen, but they're also hard to
    forget. The element of fire is much stronger in them than in normal Metal Ghosts,
    and it's said that when fused to other fire types they provide loads more experience
    as well.
  summonDesc: Are you planning <br>on using me?<br>No! Please stop!!
